@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix : <http://example.org/odp#>.

:Ontology a owl:Ontology ;
  rdfs:label "Legal Tasks Ontology" ;
  rdfs:comment "An ontology for managing legal tasks, focusing on court hierarchies and bad check crime regulations.".

# Scenario-requirement-to-axiom mapping
:Court a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "Court" ;
  rdfs:comment "A legal entity responsible for hearing and deciding cases.".

:State a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "State" ;
  rdfs:comment "A political subdivision of a country.".

:DistrictCourt subClassOf :Court ;
  rdfs:label "District Court" ;
  rdfs:comment "A court of lower jurisdiction in a state.".

:HasState rdf:Property ;
  rdfs:domain :Court ;
  rdfs:range :State ;
  rdfs:label "hasState" ;
  rdfs:comment "The state where a court is located.".

:HasSubordinate rdf:Property ;
  rdfs:domain :Court ;
  rdfs:range :Court ;
  rdfs:label "hasSubordinate" ;
  rdfs:comment "The court that has authority over a given court.".

:BadCheck a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "Bad Check" ;
  rdfs:comment "A check transaction that is not honored by the bank.".

:CheckPayment a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "Check Payment" ;
  rdfs:comment "A payment made using a check.".

:CheckTransactionType rdf:Property ;
  rdfs:domain :BadCheck ;
  rdfs:range xsd:string ;
  rdfs:label "checkTransactionType" ;
  rdfs:comment "The type of the check transaction.".

:CheckPaymentOfBadCheck rdf:Property ;
  rdfs:domain :BadCheck ;
  rdfs:range :CheckPayment ;
  rdfs:label "checkPaymentOfBadCheck" ;
  rdfs:comment "The check payment related to a bad check.".

:TransactionStatus rdf:Property ;
  rdfs:domain :CheckPayment ;
  rdfs:range xsd:string ;
  rdfs:label "transactionStatus" ;
  rdfs:comment "The status of the check payment.".

# CQ-to-axiom mapping
- List all district courts in a given state: :DistrictCourt, :HasState
- In which state is a given district court instance located?: :DistrictCourt, :HasState
- How many districts are in a given state of India?: Not directly supported, as the ontology does not contain information about the number of districts in a state.
- Which court has authority over a given court?: :Court, :HasSubordinate
- What is the check transaction type for a bad check?: :BadCheck, :CheckTransactionType
- When is a check payment of a bad check?: Not directly supported, as the ontology does not contain information about the date of a check payment.
- What is the transaction status of a given check payment?: :CheckPayment, :TransactionStatus

# Intentionally excluded concepts:
- The number of districts in a state: The ontology does not contain information about the number of districts in a state.
- The date of a check payment: The ontology does not contain information about the date of a check payment.